OL,3,GNEWSA'No improper conduct' over council
OL,4,Aland sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil bosses insist there is "no
OL,7,Fevidence" of improper conduct
OL,8,Fsurrounding a land sale.
OL,10,FNewcastle officials had come under
OL,11,Fpressure over a contentious plan for a
OL,12,Fnew 239-home estate south of the A696
OL,13,Fin Newbiggin Hall.
OL,15,FLocals had asked Newcastle City Council
OL,16,Fto designate a new country park to
OL,17,Fprotect a green corridor from being
OL,18,Fused as an access road to the proposed
OL,19,FPersimmon Homes development.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
