OL,3,GNEWSA'No improper conduct' over council
OL,4,Aland sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut it later emerged the local
OL,7,Fauthority had already struck a deal in
OL,8,F2025 to sell the strip of land, with
OL,9,Fclaims the council stands to make #3m
OL,10,Fif planning permission is ultimately
OL,11,Fgranted.
